ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110860#issuecomment-3334155361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110860","id":3334155361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Guyxh","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T13:43:10Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T13:43:39Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.6.dev ecfe34f56:\n\n> Godot v4.6.dev (ecfe34f56) - macOS Tahoe (26.0.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 Max (Apple9) - Apple M4 Max (16 threads) - 48.00 GiB memory\n\nThe particles node's visibility AABB is configured correctly, so it's not an AABB issue.\n\nNote that the pattern in which collisions occur is consistent on every restart. You can see this more easily by increasing the lifetime to 30 seconds and speed scale to 10.0.\n\n<img width=\"930\" height=\"939\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c45e9826-b621-4c52-b80b-d450be344205\" />\n\nIf you hide some of the nodes, the nodes that will collide will change:\n\n<img width=\"961\" height=\"954\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/caae7e79-a7fc-48c3-a439-799a5b638949\" />\n\t\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3334155361/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832115649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110860#issuecomment-3832115649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110860","id":3832115649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kaXHB","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T21:45:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T22:01:15Z","body":"I think this is a documentation issue and not a bug because there appears to be a hard-coded limit of 32 colliders (and attractors) for a given particle system:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/98782b6c8c9cabe0fb7c80bc62640735ecb076d3/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/particles_storage.h#L73-L77\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/98782b6c8c9cabe0fb7c80bc62640735ecb076d3/drivers/gles3/storage/particles_storage.h#L77-L81\n\nI also don't think it is documented but it seems that there is a maximum of 7 combined vector field attractors and sdf colliders on the forward renderers and they are unsupported on compatibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832115649/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]